Description: MuDi (牧笛) — terminal workspace frontend for AI coding agents
 herdr is a terminal workspace manager designed for AI coding agents.
 It provides workspace, tab, and pane management with a client-server
 architecture.
 .
 MuDi is a GUI frontend for herdr (DTK on deepin/UOS, plain Qt
 elsewhere) that embeds the herdr terminal client and auto-downloads
 the herdr binary on first launch.
